T134	Entity 24889 24893	Emma
T135	Cue 24904 24908	said
T136	Quotation 24910 25094	"You must make my apologies to your friend; but so good a charade must not be confined to one or two.  He may be sure of every woman's approbation while he writes with such gallantry."
R182	Cueing Arg1:T135 Arg2:T136	
