T137	Quotation 25095 25128	"I have no hesitation in saying,"
T138	Cue 25129 25136	replied
T139	Entity 25137 25146	Mr. Elton
T140	Quotation 25194 25482	"I have no hesitation in saying-- at least if my friend feels at all as I do -- I have not the smallest doubt that, could he see his little effusion honoured as I see it, (looking at the book again, and replacing it on the table), he would consider it as the proudest moment of his life."
R185	Cueing Arg1:T138 Arg2:T137	
R186	Speaker Arg1:T139 Arg2:T137	
