T232	Quotation 47838 47856	"Why, to be sure,"
T233	Cue 47857 47861	said
T234	Entity 47862 47875	Mr. Woodhouse
T235	Quotation 47878 48034	"yes, certainly -- I cannot deny that Mrs. Weston, poor Mrs. Weston, does come and see us pretty often-- but then-- she is always obliged to go away again."
R307	Cueing Arg1:T233 Arg2:T232	
