T304	Quotation 57511 57808	"How long it is, how terribly long since you were here! And how tired you must be after your journey!  You must go to bed early, my dear-- and I recommend a little gruel to you before you go.-- You and I will have a nice basin of gruel together.  My dear Emma, suppose we all have a little gruel."
