R410	Addressee Arg1:T301 Arg2:T304	
T305	Quotation 58160 58302	"It was an awkward business, my dear, your spending the autumn at South End instead of coming here.  I never had much opinion of the sea air."
T306	Entity 58106 58108	he
T307	Cue 58109 58126	proceeded to say,
