T484	Cue 92389 92398	continued
T485	Entity 92399 92409	Mr. Weston
T486	Quotation 92411 92715	"ever since September:  every letter has been full of it; but he cannot command his own time.  He has those to please who must be pleased, and who (between ourselves) are sometimes to be pleased only by a good many sacrifices. But now I have no doubt of seeing him here about the second week in January."
R589	Cueing Arg1:T484 Arg2:T483	
