T512	Quotation 96190 96244	"Oh, Mrs. Churchill; every body knows Mrs. Churchill,"
T513	Cue 96245 96252	replied
T514	Entity 96253 96261	Isabella
T515	Quotation 96264 96621	"and I am sure I never think of that poor young man without the greatest compassion.  To be constantly living with an ill-tempered person, must be dreadful.  It is what we happily have never known any thing of; but it must be a life of misery.  What a blessing, that she never had any children!  Poor little creatures, how unhappy she would have made them!"
R628	Addressee Arg1:T508 Arg2:T512	
R629	Addressee Arg1:T508 Arg2:T515	
R630	Cueing Arg1:T513 Arg2:T512	
