T593	Cue 112948 112955	replied
T594	Quotation 112957 113464	"It is impossible for me to doubt any longer.  You have made yourself too clear.  Mr. Elton, my astonishment is much beyond any thing I can express.  After such behaviour, as I have witnessed during the last month, to Miss Smith-- such attentions as I have been in the daily habit of observing-- to be addressing me in this manner-- this is an unsteadiness of character, indeed, which I had not supposed possible! Believe me, sir, I am far, very far, from gratified in being the object of such professions."
