T748	Quotation 181557 181681	"you are not often deficient; not often deficient either in manner or comprehension.  I think you understand me, therefore."
R935	Cueing Arg1:T746 Arg2:T745	
R936	Speaker Arg1:T747 Arg2:T745	
R937	Cueing Arg1:T746 Arg2:T748	
