T822	Quotation 188853 189115	"My father would say 'yes,' Mr. Knightley 'no;' and Miss Bates and I that he is just the happy medium.  When you have been here a little longer, Miss Fairfax, you will understand that Mr. Elton is the standard of perfection in Highbury, both in person and mind."
