T836	Cue 190998 191005	replied
T837	Entity 191006 191010	Jane
T838	Quotation 191012 191184	"I dare say I shall be interested-- but I believe it requires that with me.  And as it is some months since Miss Campbell married, the impression may be a little worn off."
R1053	Cueing Arg1:T836 Arg2:T835	
R1054	Cueing Arg1:T836 Arg2:T838	
